---
<Base title="Yaro Korets (Yaroslav Korets) — CV, AI Implementation Engineer" description="CV of Yaro (Yaroslav) Korets: AI implementation engineer, founder of Growth Control, CTO & Co-Founder of Stretch Tent. 20 years as founder and operator." path="/cv/" current="CV" type="profile" graph={graph}>
